{
  "$comment": "A hook's state from its requirement (W57, from dh-campaign's tracker). A requirement is a hook id, {\"all\": [...]}, {\"any\": [...]} or {\"char\": {dimension: value or [values]}, \"who\": \"any\"|\"all\"} (a game-system check VTT's rpg_systems evaluates; the wiki never decides it). A node evaluates to met, unmet or check: an id is met when that hook is resolved; a char node is check; all is unmet if any child is unmet, else check if any is check, else met (empty all: met); any is met if any child is met, else check if any is check, else unmet (empty any: unmet). A hook's state: resolved if it is; else from its requirement (none: met): met is available, check is needs_check, unmet is blocked. Held on the server (server/extensions/wiki_shared/Requirements.py) and in the lite edition (client/src/lib/requirements.ts).",
